# Stalwart Successor: "Whenever one or more counters are put on a creature you control, if it's the first time counters have been
# put on that creature this turn, put a +1/+1 counter on that creature" (CR 603.4). Bot1 casts it on turn 1. On turn 3 the first
# Snakeskin Veil puts a counter on it and the ability puts another (2); a second Veil that turn is not the first time (3), and the
# ability's own counter does not trigger it again. On turn 5 the first counter of that turn triggers it once more (5).

